    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECR202 · Assessment 1/2</span>\n<h2>Assignments</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 11335 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECR202 · Đầu điểm 1/2</span>\n<h2>Assignments</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 11335 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">60.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">&quot;Assignment 1: LO1-LO3 Option1: Teacher can choose written format (recommended below) or spoken format (specified by class teacher) Based on your reading of the texts in chapters 2 and 3 as well as your own research into these topics, write a short response to the following prompt. You can choose either topic1 or 2 1. Meat is an essential part of a healthy diet. Do you agree or disagree? 2. Sports are about more than just winning and losing; issues related to values and ethics also need consideration. Discuss with reference to one sport or sporting event. Option2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal Assignment 2: LO4-LO5 Option1: Teacher can choose written format (recommended below) or spoken format (specified by class teacher) Based on your reading of the texts in chapter 4 and 5 as well as your own research into these topics, write a short response to the following prompt. You can choose either topic1 or 2 1. How can we solve the energy crisis? Compare and evaluate two or more possible? 2. What qualities, skills and personal characteristics should successful leaders have? Option2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal Assignment 3: LO6-LO7 Option1: Teacher can choose written format (recommended below) or spoken format (specified by class teacher) Based on your reading of the texts in chapters 6 and 7 as well as your own research into these topics, write a short response to the following prompt. You can choose either topic1 or 2 1. Technology is a key component of education in the twenty-first century. Discuss. 2. There is a strong connection between design of the environment and at work or in school. Discuss Option2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal Assignment 4: LO8-LO9 Option1: Teacher can choose written format (recommended below) or spoken format (specified by class teacher) Based on your reading of the texts in chapters 8 and 9 as well as your own research into these topics, write a short response to the following prompt. You can choose either topic1 or 2 1. What is the relationship between the wealth of a country, its economic policies and the happiness of its citizens? 2. What is the value of social networks? Option2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal &quot;</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option1: 200~250 wordsOption2:Teacher's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Knowledge and skills in studied chapter(s)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Option1:<br><br>* homework or in class<br><br>*Peer feedback (optional): write a paragraph that analyzes the extent to which the essay did or did not meet your expectations. Were you persuaded by the<br><br>evidence? Why or why not?<br><br>Option2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">15%<br><br>Teacher selects appropriate assessment types according to the applied teaching method</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
